name: Aura — card edition
author: corpus
description: >-
  Aura adds Foil, Holographic, or Polychrome to 1 selected card. First-shop spectral
  edition engine: pair with high-value cards, Glass Joker, and retrigger effects.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - spectralCard: Aura
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: GlassJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Seltzer
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: Hack
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
